   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Taking a victim/survivor-centred approach to protection from sexual abuse, exploitation and harassment in the aid sector</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The paper maps the journey of a victim/survivor from violation to redress, exploring the challenges, existing best practice, and what a victim/survivor-centred approach could look like at each stage.</narrative>
   </description>
